WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/notifications/components/NotificationRow.tsx — renders ONE inbox row. Prop-fed a NotificationLog
  plus the resolved rule / vehicle its parent inbox looked up through ruleMap / vehicleMap. Composition:
      • selection checkbox            (aria-label t('notifications.inbox.row.select','Select notification'))
      • SeverityBadge(severity)       (severity = rule?.severity ?? 'info')
      • DateTime(created_at, in tz)   (vehicle-tz when vehicle known, else user)
      • · vehicle.display_name|#id    (when vehicle known)   · rule.name (when rule named)
      • title                         (font-medium text-primary when unread; text-secondary when read)
      • message                       (line-clamp-1, when present)
      • action cluster (group-hover): mark-read  (MailOpen,  !isRead && onMarkRead   → t('…markRead','Mark as read'))
                                       mark-unread(Mail,       isRead && onMarkUnread → t('…markUnread','Mark as unread'))
                                       archive    (Archive,    !isArchived && onArchive   → t('…archive','Archive'))
                                       restore    (ArchiveRestore, isArchived && onUnarchive→ t('…unarchive','Restore'))
                                       "View context" Link     (drillHref = rule ? getAlertDrillthroughHref(synthetic)
                                                                : null → t('alerts.viewContext','View context'))
      unread rows: left accent bar + stronger fill (border-l-2 border-l-cyan-400/70); read rows: opacity-90.
      body click (not on a control) → onActivate?(log); Enter/Space → onActivate. role=row, aria-selected.
  Data sources (bound via the P1/S8 seam, no view HTTP): useTranslation. The row is otherwise prop-fed; the per-row
  mutations (onMarkRead/onArchive/…) and the drill-through navigation are parent callbacks, modeled natively as the
  source seam's mutation + intent methods.

