PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  SeverityBadge                → NotificationRowSeverityBadge (info→statusInfo, warn→statusWarning, critical→statusDanger;
                                 missing/unknown/nil → info, the web `?? 'info'`)
  <input type=checkbox>        → NotificationRowSelectionControl (square/checkmark.square.fill; a11y "Select
                                 notification" + Selected/Not selected value + .isSelected trait)
  DateTime + ·vehicle ·rule    → wrapping NotificationRowMetaFlow (a SwiftUI Layout = web `flex flex-wrap`)
  title / message              → bold text-primary when unread else text-secondary / muted line-limited message
  unread accent                → leading 3pt accent bar + accent 5% fill (web `border-l-2 border-l-cyan-400/70`)
  ghost MailOpen/Mail          → NotificationRowActionButton(envelope.open / envelope) gated !isRead/isRead && capability
  ghost Archive/ArchiveRestore → NotificationRowActionButton(archivebox / tray.and.arrow.up) gated !isArchived/isArchived
  Link → drillHref             → NotificationRowViewContextButton (chevron.right; shown iff a rule resolved →
                                 NotificationRowDrillthrough.href maps signal→page exactly like getAlertDrillthroughHref)
  onActivate body click        → body .onTapGesture → model.activate() (gated on the .activate capability)
  load/freshness envelope      → NotificationRowPhase (loading/content/empty/error) + NotificationRowConnection
                                 (live/stale/offline): freshness chip + stale/offline banner + one guarded stale
                                 auto-refresh; offline keeps the cached row. Failed per-row mutation → inline error.
  i18n   : all 6 web keys (select, markRead, markUnread, archive, unarchive, alerts.viewContext) resolve through the
           P1/S10 facade; severity + chrome + a11y keys added; zero English string literals in code (Text(verbatim:)
           only over already-localized values).
  a11y   : decorative glyphs .accessibilityHidden; the meta/title/message is one combined element with a spoken
           severity/read/archived/time/vehicle/rule/title/message label (.isButton when activatable); the selection
           control + each action button + the view-context link carry explicit labels; Dynamic Type via tokens;
           Reduce Motion honored by TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton.
  telemetry : view.opened surface="NotificationRow" emitted once on first appearance (P1/S11), default OSLog sink.

